story_text.value:
Hi, I am a computer science teacher. So I need a persistent localhost tunnel / ngrok alternative for my students. So I built tunr as a ngrok alternative with vibecoding features. Then pivoted to an OSS service for vibecoded small apps.It lived on my personal GitHub for a while;
I've just moved it to its own org.<p><a href="https://youtu.be/1Wl0pdKN4oA" rel="nofollow">https://youtu.be/1Wl0pdKN4oA</a><p>I'd especially like to hear from people who show WIP to clients or grade
student projects: what breaks for you in that workflow?

